<title>USA: Albany International to buy Schieffer.</title>
<headline>Albany International to buy Schieffer.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albany International Corp said on Thursday it has entered into an agreement with Schieffer GmbH &amp; Co to buy Schieffer Door Systems, located in Lippstadt, Germany, for approximately $25 million.</p>
<p>Combining Schieffer Door Systems' annual sales of approximately $31 million with $55 million annual sales of Albany International's Nomafa Door will position Albany as the world market leader in the industrial door business, the company said.</p>
</text>
